@startuml UC15_RecoverPassword
title UC15 - User recovers password of the account
actor "Registered User" as User
participant "BBP System" as System

autonumber
' Entry: User is on login page

User -> System: Clicks "Forgotten password" button
activate System
System -> User: Asks for email of the account
deactivate System

User -> System: Inserts email associated to the account
activate System
System -> User: Sends OTP to the inserted email
deactivate System

User -> System: Inserts received OTP
activate System
System -> System: Validates inserted OTP

alt OTP Valid
    System -> User: Asks for new password
    User -> System: Inserts new password
    System -> System: Validates new password

    alt New Password Valid
        User -> System: Confirms new password
        
        alt Connection OK
            System -> System: Updates password of the account
            System -> User: Returns user to login page
            note right: Exit Condition: Password successfully reset
        else Exception: Connection error
            System --> User: Error: Connection failed
        end

    else Exception: New password not valid
        System --> User: Error: Password does not meet requirements
    end

else Exception: Invalid OTP
    System --> User: Error: The OTP is incorrect
end

deactivate System
@enduml